### join! – two simulated calls (100 ms + 150 ms) run concurrently -> elapsed_ms ≈ 150
GET http://localhost:3000/rooms/1/summary

### select! – calendar answers before the 500 ms deadline -> 200
GET http://localhost:3000/rooms/1/availability

### select! – calendar too slow -> 504 Gateway Timeout
GET http://localhost:3000/rooms/1/availability?latency_ms=800

### spawn_blocking – CPU-heavy work on the blocking pool
GET http://localhost:3000/reports/occupancy?iterations=200000000

### ANTI-PATTERN – blocks a worker thread for 5 s (run twice in parallel, then call /health)
GET http://localhost:3000/demo/blocking

### Correct async sleep – does not block the worker
GET http://localhost:3000/demo/non-blocking

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health
